{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Junktown Rally \u2013 Demo Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is part of a student project and represents the state of the game at the time of submission. In the current version, you can race on a single track, collect trash, use boost items, and track your lap times to monitor and improve your performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not included in this version:</strong><br>\u2013 Vehicle customization and workshop mode<br>\u2013 Additional tracks (both trash-filled and cleaned-up versions)<br>\u2013 Multiplayer mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong><br>This demo is a showcase of our progress during the project. If we receive enough feedback and interest, we may consider continuing development after graduation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891750?t=1753998089","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891750?t=1753998089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891750/ec6f2a15f9615bd30596bcb56038865bc1918f81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753998089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891750/ec6f2a15f9615bd30596bcb56038865bc1918f81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753998089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Junktown Rally \u2013 Demo Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is part of a student project and represents the state of the game at the time of submission. In the current version, you can race on a single track, collect trash, use boost items, and track your lap times to monitor and improve your performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class